Chapter: SparkCivitaiTest
  cites Spark chapter SparkCivitai

 Prints the request path of every query at both sorts, every row of each
 search answer, and the trigger words of each by-hash answer. The expected
 output is the WPF original's CivitAiClient, unmodified, reading the same
 answers from a local listener (build/spark-civitai-oracle.ps1).

